        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji̱ Kɛ-ɣath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ä-ron i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuɛ̈nɛ gaat Kɛ-ɣath rɛy gan Lii-bay, kɛ thuk duëlikiɛn kɛnɛ dho̱r gua̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A känɛ jɛ ni kä nɛy tin tekɛ run ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k amäni jiɛɛn dhieec tin lua̱ŋkɛ lät tin dëë la̱t rɛy kɛmɛkä ro̱mä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä lät gan Kɛ-ɣath rɛy kɛmɛkä ro̱mä ni tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gua̱a̱th in ci wec thia̱k kɛ ɣöth la Ä-ron kɛnɛ gaatkɛ a coth rɛy kɛmɛkä bikɛ geel nhial ka̱p piny kä bikɛ jɛ kum ni thanduk matdä ruaacni Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ jɛ yi̱k piny kɛ ko̱l dɛ̈ɛ̈l, kä bikɛ wi̱cdɛ kum kɛ bi̱i̱ mi yiel, kä ba cu la̱th rɛy ri̱i̱wnikɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ba wi̱c Tharbët kä mi̱eth jurayni pa̱p bi̱i̱ mi yiel, kä ba kuak la̱th thi̱n, thääk tin la waŋkɛ wal, kɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱k ma̱th mucni. Kä juray nhiam Kuɔth bɛ te thi̱n bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikɛ kɛ yi̱k piny kɛ bi̱i̱ mi do̱l, kä bikɛ kɛ kum kɛ ko̱l dɛ̈ɛ̈l kä bikɛ ri̱i̱wnikɛ la̱th thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ bi̱i̱ in yiel ka̱n, kä bikɛ gua̱a̱th cuuŋ lɛmbärä kum kɛ jɛ kɛɛl kɛnɛ lɛmbärni ɛ kɛ min la kuanykɛ jɛ kɛ min cuɔ̱thkɛ jɛ, kɛ kuakɛ diaal tin te liɛth in la pɛ̈tkɛ jɛ thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ba la̱th kä min la kap kɛ jɛ kɛɛl kɛ kuakɛ diaal a ca kum kɛ ko̱l dɛ̈ɛ̈l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikɛ yi̱k dääpä wi̱cdɛ moc kɛ bi̱i̱ mi yiel, kä ba kuɔ̱m piny kɛ ko̱l dɛ̈ɛ̈l, kä ba la̱th kä ri̱i̱wnikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ kuak diaal tin ci naath lät kɛ kɛ rɛy luaak Kuɔth, la̱th rɛy biey mi yiel, kä ba kɛ kum kɛ ko̱l dɛ̈ɛ̈l, kä ba kɛ la̱th kä min la kap kɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bikɛ ŋɛ̈th naŋ raar wi̱i̱ yi̱kä kä la̱th kɛ bi̱i̱ mi do̱l thi̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bikɛ kuak yi̱kä diaal tin ca lät ni la̱t, thak maac, tuɔ̱ŋ, kɛ nyinkɛ diaal tin la̱t kɛ la̱t. Ba kɛ yi̱k piny kɛ ko̱l dɛ̈ɛ̈l, kä ba to̱ŋkɛ la̱th thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä Ä-ron kɛnɛ gaatkɛ wä thuɔ̱k kɛ kum kɛmɛkä kɛnɛ kuakɛ diaal mi ɣöth kɛ wec, ɛn wa̱nɔ bi gaat Kɛ-ɣath ben ba kɛ ben kap, ɛ ni ɣöö ca tin rɛl gɔɔydiɛn rɔ̱ bi nyɔt kɛ ɣöö /ci kɛ bi li̱w. Ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn kuak kɛmɛkä ro̱mä tin bi gaat Kɛ-ɣath kɛ kap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi Ɛl-a-dhar gat Ä-ron in bo̱o̱th palä la̱tdɛ a liɛth lɛmbär kɛnɛ wal tin kɔp kɛ muc bɛɛl kɛnɛ liɛth yi̱rä, kɛɛl kɛ tin diaal tin kɔ̱kiɛn rɛy kɛmɛkä tin ca lëy Kuoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
